From 418be2d8b9c381270c8545e255ac32cb5fdf492a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:28:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(javascript): split wrapped call-path and
 member-mutation steps

Move cohesive closure groups out of collectElectronWrappedCallPathsSteps
(1,358 lines) and collectSemanticMemberMutationsSteps (1,494 lines) into
owning modules. Code moves verbatim; the shared visit budget and effect
counter become small mutable objects so every module draws on the same
bound. Public entry points and behavior are unchanged.
